Package: swedishairquality
Type: Package
Title: Air Quality (PM10) Data for Major Swedish Cities
Version: 2.0.0
Date: 2021-09-25
Authors@R: c(
    person("Raja Uzair", "Saeed", email = "rajsa233@student.liu.se", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Daniel", "Persson", email = "danpe586@student.liu.se", role = "aut"))
Description: Wraps the SMHI air quality REST API to download recent PM10
    particulate matter measurements for six Swedish cities (Linkoping,
    Stockholm, Malmo, Gothenburg, Lulea and Umea) and visualises them in a
    Shiny web application.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
