Imports:
    jsonlite,
    httr,
    dplyr
Suggests:
    shiny,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.1.2
